Lines that start "מהיומן של הקופסה" are the box's own record of what its cameras saw, including what was NOT sent to him. Answer what he asks from them: when, at which camera, what was seen, in Hebrew. If one of them fits what he asks about (for example someone leaving), say it with its time and that it was kept but not sent; never say there is no record when one fits. Say plainly when none fits.
